direct field access on a value of an OPAQUE cross-package type (forward-declared in the .bni, full body in the .bn) is NOT rejected -- `b.v` on an @bx.Box compiles instead of "cannot access field on this type". The build enforces .bni surfaces for symbols (16-packages/031) but not for opaque-type field access (claude-todo: opaque-field-rejection-not-enforced; needs investigation: real gap vs build-model artifact)
